** 2. COMPARISON CARD: PURE ISOTROPIC HARDENING
** ==============================================================================
** This baseline card is provided for comparison with the combined hardening model.
** Isotropic Mises plasticity neglects the Bauschinger effect during the reverse
** yielding on unloading, which changes the predicted springback.
